<reference id="roles-and-responsibilities-for-onboarding" xml:lang="en">
<title>Roles and responsibilities for onboarding</title>
<shortdesc>Who does what when a new employee joins <ph keyref="company">Meridian Freight</ph>, and how long each part may take. Use this table to find out whom to ask when a request stalls. Fictional sample written for this portfolio.</shortdesc>
<refbody>
<section><title>Responsibility matrix</title>
<p>R is responsible for doing the work, A is accountable for the result, C is consulted, and I is informed.</p>
<simpletable frame="topbot"><sthead><stentry>Activity</stentry><stentry>HR</stentry><stentry>Hiring manager</stentry><stentry><ph keyref="desk">Service Desk</ph></stentry><stentry>Application owner</stentry><stentry>Security team</stentry></sthead><strow><stentry>Record the new employee</stentry><stentry>R, A</stentry><stentry>C</stentry><stentry>I</stentry><stentry></stentry><stentry></stentry></strow><strow><stentry>Submit the onboarding request</stentry><stentry>I</stentry><stentry>R, A</stentry><stentry>I</stentry><stentry></stentry><stentry></stentry></strow><strow><stentry>Create the identity and mailbox</stentry><stentry></stentry><stentry>I</stentry><stentry>R, A</stentry><stentry></stentry><stentry></stentry></strow><strow><stentry>Order and image the laptop</stentry><stentry></stentry><stentry>C</stentry><stentry>R, A</stentry><stentry></stentry><stentry></stentry></strow><strow><stentry>Approve application access</stentry><stentry></stentry><stentry>C</stentry><stentry>I</stentry><stentry>R, A</stentry><stentry></stentry></strow><strow><stentry>Approve privileged roles</stentry><stentry></stentry><stentry></stentry><stentry>I</stentry><stentry>C</stentry><stentry>R, A</stentry></strow><strow><stentry>Grant access</stentry><stentry></stentry><stentry>I</stentry><stentry>R, A</stentry><stentry>I</stentry><stentry></stentry></strow><strow><stentry>Confirm the first-day checklist</stentry><stentry></stentry><stentry>R, A</stentry><stentry>I</stentry><stentry></stentry><stentry></stentry></strow><strow><stentry>Review privileged roles every ninety days</stentry><stentry></stentry><stentry>C</stentry><stentry>I</stentry><stentry>R</stentry><stentry>A</stentry></strow><strow><stentry>Remove access when someone leaves</stentry><stentry>R</stentry><stentry>C</stentry><stentry>R, A</stentry><stentry>I</stentry><stentry>I</stentry></strow></simpletable>
</section>
<section><title>Service levels</title>
<p>The clock starts when the previous activity is complete, during working hours at the location of the new employee.</p>
<simpletable frame="topbot"><sthead><stentry>Activity</stentry><stentry>Target</stentry><stentry>Measured from</stentry></sthead><strow><stentry>Check the onboarding request</stentry><stentry>One working day</stentry><stentry>Submission of the request</stentry></strow><strow><stentry>Create the identity and mailbox</stentry><stentry>One working day</stentry><stentry>The request is checked</stentry></strow><strow><stentry>Laptop delivered to the location</stentry><stentry>Three working days</stentry><stentry>The order is placed</stentry></strow><strow><stentry>Application owner’s decision</stentry><stentry>Two working days</stentry><stentry>The owner is added as an approver</stentry></strow><strow><stentry>Security team’s decision on a privileged role</stentry><stentry>Three working days</stentry><stentry>The owner’s approval</stentry></strow><strow><stentry>First-day checklist confirmed</stentry><stentry>Two working days</stentry><stentry>The start date</stentry></strow></simpletable>
</section>
<section><title>Who to contact</title>
<simpletable frame="topbot"><sthead><stentry>Question</stentry><stentry>Contact</stentry></sthead><strow><stentry>The start date or manager is wrong</stentry><stentry>HR operations, through the <b>People</b> queue in the <ph keyref="desk">Service Desk</ph> portal</stentry></strow><strow><stentry>An application owner hasn’t answered</stentry><stentry>The owner’s deputy, listed in the application catalogue</stentry></strow><strow><stentry>A privileged role is urgent</stentry><stentry>The security on-call engineer, through the <b>Security</b> queue</stentry></strow><strow><stentry>The laptop hasn’t arrived</stentry><stentry>Hardware logistics, through the <b>Hardware</b> queue</stentry></strow></simpletable>
</section>
<section><title>Standard access by department</title>
<p>Every employee gets a mailbox, the intranet, and the chat tool through their department group. The groups below add the applications the department uses every day. Anything else needs a request.</p>
<simpletable frame="topbot"><sthead><stentry>Department</stentry><stentry>Group</stentry><stentry>Adds</stentry></sthead><strow><stentry>Operations</stentry><stentry><codeph>grp-ops-standard</codeph></stentry><stentry>Dispatch board, fleet telematics (read), customer portal (agent)</stentry></strow><strow><stentry>Finance</stentry><stentry><codeph>grp-fin-standard</codeph></stentry><stentry>Ledger (read), expenses, procurement portal</stentry></strow><strow><stentry>Sales</stentry><stentry><codeph>grp-sales-standard</codeph></stentry><stentry>CRM, quoting tool, customer portal (read)</stentry></strow><strow><stentry>Engineering</stentry><stentry><codeph>grp-eng-standard</codeph></stentry><stentry>Source control, CI, the staging environment</stentry></strow><strow><stentry>Human resources</stentry><stentry><codeph>grp-hr-standard</codeph></stentry><stentry>HR system, recruitment tool, learning platform</stentry></strow></simpletable>
</section>
</refbody>
</reference>
